// IntroString :
"P3361069679" "Ready to cause some mayhem in Paragon City? <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go to Steel Canyon and hit one of the banks there.</A> Once you hit Steel Canyon you'll have 15 minutes to rob the bank and escape.<br><br><color orange>This is a Mayhem Mission. You can earn extra experience by causing destruction in the city before completing your main mission.</color>"
